---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "March 22, 2025";
---

<Layout
    title="Legal notice — Tin Sever"
    description="Imprint, privacy, and legal information for tin-sever.de."
    noindex
>
    <main
        class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200"
    >
        <h1
            class="font-light text-3xl tracking-tight text-black dark:text-white"
        >
            Legal Notice
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-white/55">
            Last updated: {lastUpdated}
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="imprint-heading">
                <h2
                    id="imprint-heading"
                    class="text-lg font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                >
                    1. Legal Notice / Imprint
                </h2>
                <p>
                    Information provided pursuant to Section 5 DDG and, where
                    applicable, Article 18 MStV.
                </p>
                <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
                        Website operator / responsible for this website
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-1">
                        Tin Sever<br />
                        c/o Autorenglück #29344<br />
                        Albert-Einstein-Str. 47<br />
                        02977 Hoyerswerda<br />
                        Germany
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
                        Contact
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-1">
                        Email:{" "}
                        <a href="mailto:t2sever@pm.me">t2sever@pm.me</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
                        Responsible for editorial content
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-1">
                        Tin Sever<br />
                        c/o Autorenglück #29344<br />
                        Albert-Einstein-Str. 47<br />
                        02977 Hoyerswerda<br />
                        Germany
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Unless otherwise stated, the content of this website is
                    created by the website operator. Blog articles are licensed
                    under{" "}
                    <a
                        href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"
                        rel="license"
                        >Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
                        International (CC BY-SA 4.0)</a
                    >
                    unless a post states otherwise.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="space-y-6" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
                <h2
                    id="privacy-heading"
                    class="text-lg font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                >
                    2. Privacy Policy
                </h2>
                <p>
                    This Privacy Policy explains how personal data is processed
                    when you visit this website.
                </p>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.1 Controller
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        The controller responsible for data processing on this
                        website is:
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Tin Sever<br />
                        c/o Autorenglück #29344<br />
                        Albert-Einstein-Str. 47<br />
                        02977 Hoyerswerda<br />
                        Germany<br />
                        Email:{" "}
                        <a href="mailto:t2sever@pm.me">t2sever@pm.me</a>
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.2 Hosting and server log files
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        When you visit this website, technical data may be
                        processed automatically by the hosting provider in
                        server log files. This may include, in particular:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                        <li>IP address</li>
                        <li>date and time of the request</li>
                        <li>requested page/file</li>
                        <li>referrer URL</li>
                        <li>browser type and version</li>
                        <li>operating system</li>
                        <li>access status</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        This processing is necessary to ensure the technical
                        operation, stability and security of the website.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong class="text-black dark:text-white"
                            >Legal basis:</strong
                        >
                        Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interests in secure and reliable
                        website operation).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.3 Informational use of the website
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        You can use this website for informational purposes
                        without actively submitting personal data. This website
                        provides blog content, information about me, and links
                        to third-party websites.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.4 Contact by email
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        If you contact me by email, the data you provide (for
                        example your email address, name, and the content of
                        your message) will be processed in order to handle your
                        request.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong class="text-black dark:text-white"
                            >Legal basis:</strong
                        >
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                        <li>
                            Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR, if your request relates to
                            pre-contractual or contractual matters; or
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR, based on the legitimate interest
                            in responding to inquiries.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        The data will be retained only as long as necessary to
                        process your request and to comply with any legal
                        retention obligations.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.5 External links
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        This website contains links to external websites
                        operated by third parties. When you click such a link,
                        you leave this website. I have no control over the
                        content or data processing practices of third-party
                        websites and assume no responsibility for them. Please
                        review the privacy policies of the respective external
                        websites.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.6 Cookies and similar technologies
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        This website does not use cookies that require consent.
                        At present, this website does not use analytics,
                        tracking, marketing cookies, or similar consent-based
                        technologies.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        A display preference (light or dark mode) may be stored
                        locally in your browser and is not sent to the server.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.7 Recipients of data
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Personal data may be disclosed to service providers only
                        where necessary for operating the website, in particular
                        to:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                        <li>the hosting provider</li>
                        <li>IT or security service providers, if applicable</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        Data will otherwise only be disclosed where there is a
                        legal obligation to do so.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.8 International data transfers
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Where personal data is transferred to recipients outside
                        the EU/EEA, this is done only in accordance with the
                        applicable legal requirements, for example on the basis
                        of an adequacy decision or appropriate safeguards.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.9 Retention period
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Personal data is stored only for as long as necessary
                        for the respective purposes. Server log data is
                        generally stored for a limited period as required for
                        security and technical operations.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Where statutory retention obligations apply, the
                        relevant data will be stored for the duration required
                        by law.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.10 Your rights under the GDPR
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        You have the following rights, subject to the applicable
                        legal requirements:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                        <li>right of access (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
                        <li>right to rectification (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
                        <li>right to erasure (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
                        <li>
                            right to restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)
                        </li>
                        <li>right to data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
                        <li>right to object (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        Where processing is based on consent, you have the right
                        to withdraw your consent at any time with effect for the
                        future.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.11 Right to lodge a complaint
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a
                        supervisory authority for data protection, in particular
                        in the EU member state of your habitual residence, place
                        of work, or place of the alleged infringement.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.12 No obligation to provide data
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        You are generally not legally or contractually required
                        to provide personal data when visiting this website.
                        However, certain functions such as contacting me by
                        email may not be available without providing the
                        necessary data.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3
                        class="text-base font-semibold text-black dark:text-white"
                    >
                        2.13 Changes to this Privacy Policy
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time in
                        order to reflect legal, technical, or operational
                        changes. The current version available on this page
                        applies.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
